    "sections": {
        "description": "Omega Furniture Store Theme is designed for furniture catalog presentation and product-focused layouts. The theme includes a structured homepage with sections for featured products, banners, categories, and customer information. It supports responsive layouts that adjust across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. The design uses organized typography and balanced spacing to improve content readability and product visibility. The theme includes customization settings for colors, fonts, header layouts, footer sections, and homepage blocks through the built-in customizer. It also supports image galleries, product showcase sections, navigation menus, and social media integration. Clean code structure and optimized layouts help maintain stable performance and compatibility with common plugins. Additional features include slider support, call-to-action sections, blog integration, and multiple page templates. The overall layout focuses on presenting furniture collections in a structured and visually consistent format without relying on complex setup processes."
    },
